# Ollama Modelfile — serves the fine-tuned, 4-bit-quantized MolChat model
# with an OpenAI-compatible API. Build: `ollama create molchat -f p2/Modelfile`
FROM ./llama.cpp/molchat-q4_k_m.gguf

PARAMETER temperature 0.2
PARAMETER num_ctx 2048

SYSTEM """You are MolChat, a molecular-chemistry assistant. Answer questions
about molecular properties, physicochemical descriptors, blood-brain-barrier
permeability, and molecular similarity. Be concise and state when an estimate is
a rule-of-thumb rather than a measured value."""
